      "description": "Keyword ideas for a seed keyword from Google autocomplete (the seed plus question words or the alphabet), People Also Ask and related searches, cleaned and de-duplicated. Each idea carries its sources and an intent label (question, comparison, commercial, local, informational). Works in Arabic. Ideas only: no search volumes. Charged for the results page (7 credits live, 1 from your cache) plus 7 credits for each autocomplete call that returns suggestions, so at most 14 credits for expand 'none', 70 for 'questions' (the default), 196 for 'alphabet' (210 for an Arabic seed) and 217 for 'all'; it stops early once `limit` ideas are found, which is 12. Set fresh to true to search the results page live; autocomplete is always live.",
